    "turn_text": "I think is the reason why he wants him here. Congressman, you've seen the lineup now of people wanting to oppose him, saying they'll never confirm him, confirm him. Others saying they're very, very skeptical about this. They want to see the ethics report from the congressional ethics committee. So what are your thoughts on on Matt Gates? And is this possible to get this bunker buster of an AG into the DOJ?",
