    "turn_text": "Well I'll say what I said last look at a number of interviews and it's I say because it's what I believe. Matt Gates is the kind of guy if he's running the DOJ is not going to be saying we need to investigate moms and dads who are going to their kids school board meetings. Matt Gates is the kind of guy who's who's not going to have the Richmond field office right a memorandum which says if you're a pro-life Catholic you're an extremist and maybe he's the kind of AG who will actually tell us who planted the pipe bombs on January 6 who leaked the Dobbs opinion And who put cocaine at the White House? Those are some simple answers I think the American people would like to have. They actually want agencies and their government to work for them. And it's why I like so many of the picks cards that Trump has put forward because they understand that fundamental fact. It's about advancing freedom and limiting the agency's ability to go after. They shouldn't do any of it going after the very people they're supposed to serve. So I like Paltia, I like RFK Jr. i thought he picked it yesterday i like i like all those people because they're going to shake up the very agency they've been nominated to be",
