    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/4/9/49555.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 11,
    "turn_text": "Yeah, and Matt Gates, of course, of course, is maybe the most high-profile appointee that the left and even some on the rhino establishment are targeting. But Pete Haggseth, RFK Junior as well, which begs the question, should the president be prepared and should the Senate, you know, essentially push these things off and allow President Trump to use recess appointments with these very, very high-profile positions?",
