    "turn_text": "uh... i think that's fair uh... and and that should be the priority no question about the criminal element has got to be removed in this country first i mean obviously we're watching the lake and rally a killers trial or alleged killers trial and uh... it is brutal to think about being a hard she fought for seventeen minutes and everything else and she did not have to go through that no one else should have to go through that people who should never been here in the first place victimizing us so i i hope there is bipartisan support for at least that element of this and yet here we sit Without it, Kenny Hobbs, JB Pritzker, Jared Polis, Maura Healy, Brandon Johnson, Michelle Woo, governors and mayors of big cities who have all pledged to resist Trump deportation orders, saying they will prioritize the protection of the illegal aliens in their cities and states over the safety of the people. Now, they didn't say it that way, but that's what essentially they're saying they will do by trying to stop President Trump, your thoughts on those efforts.",
    "speaker_id": "SPEAKER_03",
    "inferred_speaker_name": null,
    "inferred_speaker_role": null,
    "chosen_text_key": "transcript",
